e urgent shift toward decentralized production – revealing how networks of agile, software-defined factories deploy manufacturing directly to the point of need, securing industrial sovereignty across mobility, aerospace, and mission-critical supply chains.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T14:20:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T14:40:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"90a7d849-c0d0-473d-becf-b9cab8096e3d","name":"Stage 13","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"e9151671-f052-4a05-b8dc-ea4edac3dd10","name":"Edward Mehr","company_name":"Machina Labs","job_title":"Co-Founder & CEO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/1ipbb43c5pp0ln1b3tjy53aevqod?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/1ipbb43c5pp0ln1b3tjy53aevqod?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/1ipbb43c5pp0ln1b3tjy53aevqod?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/1ipbb43c5pp0ln1b3tjy53aevqod?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/1ipbb43c5pp0ln1b3tjy53aevqod?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}},{"id":"","attendance_id":"eabcb825-621d-4c2e-a66c-424a1f09e921","name":"Graham Fraser","company_name":"BBC News","job_title":"Senior Journalist","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/zx4ns394h8kx81ylqrplxtqz0ffc?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/zx4ns394h8kx81ylqrplxtqz0ffc?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/zx4ns394h8kx81ylqrplxtqz0ffc?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/zx4ns394h8kx81ylqrplxtqz0ffc?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/zx4ns394h8kx81ylqrplxtqz0ffc?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"AI Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"f92b9275-f201-48ae-937f-14107b483eab","slug":"vivaldi-v-goliath-the-case-for-sovereign-code","title":"Vivaldi v Goliath: The case for sovereign code","description":"From the creator of Opera and CEO of Vivaldi, Jon von Tetzchner comes a counter-trend masterclass in web ethics. While big tech rushes to embed AI into every application, Vivaldi intentionally avoids integrating AI into the browser to protect data privacy. Learn why Europe needs to construct its own independent web infrastructure to maintain digital sovereignty, and how this privacy-first philosophy is putting Vivaldi at the frontier of a market that did not exist before.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T14:25:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T14:45:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"685b779a-20e7-4280-b402-b239764fb6d6","name":"Stage 10","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"59b200a0-5b1b-46d6-9969-14402081229d","name":"Jon von Tetzchner","company_name":"Vivaldi","job_title":"Co-founder & CEO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/j10ui42f0y80p1dvab9td7uvvcfv?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/j10ui42f0y80p1dvab9td7uvvcfv?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/j10ui42f0y80p1dvab9td7uvvcfv?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/j10ui42f0y80p1dvab9td7uvvcfv?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/j10ui42f0y80p1dvab9td7uvvcfv?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}},{"id":"","attendance_id":"b0fe8b14-aaa8-455c-995b-1b51